Third-party components
----------------------
No third-party source is copied into this folder. The scripts in `scripts/` are
original and import only the Python standard library; the libraries they call
once installed — cryptography, pypdf, python-docx, openpyxl, Pillow, and
optionally pytesseract or paddleocr — are installed by the user with
`python scripts/setup_deps.py` and stay under their own licences. The
repository's THIRD-PARTY-NOTICES.md records each one, its licence and its
upstream URL.
